# Results disclosure control — code is public, results are not until we choose.
# Result-bearing docs and figures live here and are never tracked. See CLAUDE.md
# "Results Disclosure Control". WARNING: .gitignore does NOT untrack files already
# committed, nor remove them from history — anything ever committed is exposed when
# the repo goes public. Purge history (or publish from a clean history) separately.
docs/results/
figures/
scripts/data/
