# Human coding exports (verbal/behavioral coding pulled from REDCap etc.).
# Study data, not code — never track, regardless of PHI status. Broad glob so a
# new export with a different study/date prefix can't slip in via `git add -A`.
verbal_*.csv
*_coding_export*.csv

